              "node_type": "item",
              "title": "ClipKeeper",
              "description": "is a free, open source (MIT) tray companion for OBS on Windows 10/11 for people who clip with the replay buffer. It watches OBS through obs-websocket and fixes what silently breaks a recording — a source losing its audio device after a driver update, a crashed replay buffer, audio that never reaches OBS, a black capture — and checks every saved clip. It also sorts clips into a library by game, with a trim editor and one-click export for Discord. Built with AI assistance (Claude Code).",
              "children": [],
